   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_09289b5dba4a7e19c345",
   "sourceHash": "09289b5dba4a7e19c34560c07683eb9763a072c736a8277b98cfc67c9710ad03",
   "text": "从印度各大城市前往 Kairali 的最佳方式是什么？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd42bbd25ed3a660923f",
   "sourceHash": "fd42bbd25ed3a660923fdfab7b3a2b65f9ce7811679c5c2a1b5ddd9babdd95f7",
   "text": "从德里、孟买、班加罗尔或金奈出发：乘飞机前往哥印拜陀，并使用我们的机场接送服务。从喀拉拉邦境内出发：乘火车前往帕拉卡德枢纽站，或直接驾车前往医院——预订后我们会提供详细路线指引。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3b7d4d193c691f021437",
   "sourceHash": "3b7d4d193c691f02143702aa6dfd045fcef869db0f87c1c9e75a8dd799666b12",
   "text": "Kairali 距离附近的旅游景点有多远？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c146756b6b9681a606ae",
   "sourceHash": "c146756b6b9681a606aea132c89ab4ec4d517056e8eb75d4a41bf1b4f3def775",
   "text": "各景点距离不一；以下是我们景点页面目前列出的几处：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_13f28ad0954c6c3a5871",
   "sourceHash": "13f28ad0954c6c3a5871d4dcc02179e03778ce1001adafec1dafa4592affbb18",
   "text": "寂静谷国家公园（Silent Valley National Park）— 80 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_158cff5230fb9e6245e0",
   "sourceHash": "158cff5230fb9e6245e0e709874ab70ae6497e8b874e23483f5d3e58637065dd",
   "text": "帕兰比库拉姆野生动物保护区（Parambikulam Wildlife Sanctuary）— 100 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2293bae4286cc0b22040",
   "sourceHash": "2293bae4286cc0b2204080214f67cb7eb13fb129da5f4ef9a954cac65d8379a6",
   "text": "蒂普苏丹城堡（Tipu's Fort）— 14 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b0bbea4fe73ff562e19",
   "sourceHash": "9b0bbea4fe73ff562e1944168cd444a54150d9b0bec4dec39f2e681428489a13",
   "text": "查看按距离排列的完整列表：[[OPEN_1]]10 公里以内[[CLOSE_1]]、[[OPEN_2]]15 公里及以内[[CLOSE_2]]、[[OPEN_3]]25–50 公里[[CLOSE_3]]和[[OPEN_4]]50 公里以上[[CLOSE_4]]。如有需要，我们可以安排前往这些地点的一日游。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
